==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Water Must Flow!]] in order to do [[Quest:The Secret Ingredient Is...]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Wheelie Pete needs you to help out a friend of his in Sunstone
*Meet Peace-guana Joe
*Pass out the Peace Flyer - /5
*Return to Peace-guana Joe
*Return to Wheelie Pete
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"The last ingredient in my Sunstone Sasparilla is top secret! Only my old friend <font color='#D9781A'>Peace-guana Joe</font> knows what it is.<br />Joe was the Sandscale boss before the tribe went crazy. Now he won’t trade with me unless I <font color='#D9781A'>send him some help</font>. Are you up for it?" -Wheelie Pete
#Meet with [[Peace-guana Joe]] located in [[Sandscale Territory]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Hey man, you’re Pete’s friend right? That’s righteous dude.<br />So here’s the deal. I’m trying to win back my tribe with these <font color='#D9781A'>Peace Flyers</font>. If you <font color='D9781A'>pass them out</font> I’ll hook you up with Pete’s secret ingredient. Sound good?" -Peace-guana Joe
#Pass out the Peace Flyer - /5
#*Pass out Peace Flyers to [[Peaceful Sandscale|Peacefull Sandscales]] located around Sandscale Territory. There are guides and watch out for Enemies!
#**"All this fighting hasn't done a thing for us. I'm ready for peace!" -Peaceful Sandscale
#**"Oh, uh, thanks. I hope Sandspear doesn't see me with this..." -Peaceful Sandscale
#**"Wow, a peace flyer? Maybe Peace-guana Joe was right about peace after all." -Peaceful Sandscale
#**"Yeah! Peace and love forever, man!" -Peaceful Sandscale
#Return to Peace-guana Joe located in [[Sandscale Territory]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Right on, <Player Name>! The war for peace and love may not be over, but you’ve won a major victory today.<br />And here is Pete’s secret ingredient, just like I promised. Let him know I’ve sent along some positive vibes with it." -Peace-guana Joe
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Ha, the secret ingredient! With this I can finally finish brewing my famous Sunstone Sasparilla!<br />And as promised you get the first barrel." -Wheelie Pete

